   763|/**
   764| * Self-bootstrapping DDL: creates the durable task table through the Supabase
   765| * Management API (the only SQL path in the Render runtime — same pattern as
   766| * the migration runner). Idempotent; non-fatal when the token is absent.
   767| * Retries transient gateway errors (including 544) with bounded backoff.
